  m_Name: Passage_Act3_7Eleven_Arrival
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SundayLastBreath.Data.StoryPassageData
  passageId: Act3_7Eleven_Arrival
  passageTitle: ACT3 7ELEVEN ARRIVAL
  associatedRoomId: seven_eleven
  backdropSprite: {fileID: 0}
  keepPreviousBackdrop: 0
  animatedBackdropFrames: []
  animationFPS: 8
  musicAction: 0
  backgroundMusicOrAmbience: {fileID: 0}
  musicVolume: 0.5
  entranceSFX: {fileID: 0}
  sfxVolume: 0.8
  speakerName: 
  storyText: "ROUTE 9 \u2014 7-ELEVEN COMMERCIAL STRIP\r\n/* DYNAMIC LEADER CONFIGURATION */"
  narrativeBeats:
  - The tires of Reyes' pickup screech to a halt behind a rusted delivery van across from the 7-Eleven gas station.
  - Shattered glass glints in the flickering fluorescent canopy lights. Black smoke billows from an overturned sedan near the gas pumps.
  - Inside the convenience store, rapid gunshot flashes illuminate the shattered windows. You can hear the guttural shrieks of infected mixed with angry shouting from armed scavengers!
  - "ROUTE 9 \u2014 7-ELEVEN COMMERCIAL STRIP"
  - "[DAYLIGHT ASSAULT]\r\n    Bright morning daylight illuminates the chaos, but infected are spilling out from the alleyways behind the strip mall!"
  - "[PRE-DAWN ASSAULT]\r\n    Heavy mist and rain swirl under the flickering neon \"7-ELEVEN\" sign, casting eerie shadows across the parking lot."
  - The tires of Reyes' pickup screech to a violent halt behind a rusted delivery van across from the commercial strip.
  - Shattered plate glass glints in the flickering fluorescent canopy lights. Thick black smoke billows from an overturned sedan near the diesel pumps.
  - Inside the convenience store, rapid muzzle flashes pierce the gloom. The guttural shrieks of infected echo over the harsh crack of hunting rifles and desperate shouts.
  - "[DAYLIGHT ASSAULT \u2014 09:30 AM]\r\n                    Harsh morning daylight strips away any concealment, revealing dozens of shambling corpses drawn to the gunfire from adjacent strip mall parking lots.\r\n                \r\n                    [PRE-DAWN ASSAULT \u2014 02:45 AM]\r\n                    Freezing rain cascades under the buzzing neon sign, shrouding the shattered storefront in pitch black shadows and rising steam."
  - '[COMBAT ASSAULT] Charge straight through the shattered front glass with Reyes, weapons hot.'
  - '[COMBAT ASSAULT] Charge straight through the front entrance with Reyes, weapons hot.'
  - "= 2 or hasTrait(\"STEALTH\") or hasTrait(\"SCAVENGER\")>>\r\n        \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                \r\n            \r\n            [STEALTH / TRAIT CHECK] Sneak around the back alley to catch the scavengers from behind.\r\n        \r\n    \r\n        \r\n            \U0001F977 Flank around the rear dumpster [REQUIRES STEALTH 2]\n\r\n            You need higher stealth to maneuver around the alley silently.\r\n        \r\n    \r\n            = 2 or hasTrait(\"STEALTH\") or hasTrait(\"SCAVENGER\")>>\r\n                \r\n                    \r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                        \r\n                    \r\n                    [STEALTH / TRAIT CHECK] Sneak down the rear service alley to ambush the scavengers from behind.\r\n                \r\n            \r\n                \r\n                    \U0001F977 Flank around rear alley service door [REQUIRES STEALTH 2]\n\r\n                    You need higher stealth or tactical traits to maneuver through the alley unseen."
  dialogueLines:
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: There's Miller's armored pickup truck smashed straight through the front entrance glass! Scavengers have them pinned against the beverage cooler at the back!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: There's _leaderPossessive armored pickup truck smashed straight through the front entrance glass! Scavengers have them pinned against the beverage cooler at the back!
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: We need to breach the store and relieve _leaderRef before they run out of ammo and get overrun! How do you want to handle this, $firstName?
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
  - introNarration: 
    speakerName: Reyes
    side: 1
    avatarSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fafca2e534bf20aa39a4a695c872da2d, type: 3}
    animatedAvatarFrames: []
    avatarFPS: 8
    dialogueText: We need to breach the store and relieve Miller's team before they get overwhelmed! How do you want to play this?
    outroNarration: 
    requiresStoryFlag: 
    requiresNotFlag: 
